Summary & Conclusion — 4:15–5:00
Recap:
Space = all descendants 
 >  = only direct children 
 +  = one next sibling 
 ~  = all following siblings 
When to use: Keep code cleaner; avoid extra classes; style based on structure
Final takeaway: Master combinators = precise control without cluttering your HTML

